# Checks that have NEVER been read against the obligation they measure: the number of
# suites/*/IMPLEMENTS rows whose snapshot column is `unreviewed`, and the most it may ever be.
#
# A RATCHET, exactly like requirements/UNEXECUTED-CEILING (D14) and docs/SOURCES-CITATION-DEBT.
# tools/implements-gate.py measures it every run and FAILS if it rises. Lowered by READING a check
# against its requirement and writing the snapshot it implements; NEVER by typing a version string,
# which is the edit this ledger exists to make visible.
#
