#            refusal via a helper documented as being for rows that PIN NO CODE. So the file's own
#            recorded prediction could not have fired: the instrument passed every peer the
#            prediction was about.
#
# 26 at 2026-09-16 (first measurement, over 28), then 25. Reviewed so far, all at v0.8.2.26:
#   ECP-R7   re-authored + re-implemented, then RE-SCOPED the same day when .26 ruled its probe's
